<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear [Dr./Prof.] {!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},</font></p><p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">

</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Following the review of your application titled <b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">“</b><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">”</b>, the&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;has requested </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">resubmission</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> with
revisions.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please review the comments below carefully and prepare the revised
submission latest by {!IndividualApplication.Due_Date_for_Resubmission__c}.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comments:&nbsp;</b></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approval_Comments__c}.</b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><br></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please don’t hesitate to reach out to&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!IndividualApplication.Coe_Email_Address__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;to assist with any questions or clarifications during the
resubmission process.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your attention to this matter.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">





